<title>JAPAN: Japan July-Sept output seen up 1.5% qtr/qtr - MITI.</title>
<headline>Japan July-Sept output seen up 1.5% qtr/qtr - MITI.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's industrial production for the July-September quarter is forecast to rise 1.5 percent from the previous quarter and to rise 3.7 percent from the same period a year earlier, a Ministry of International Trade and Industry (MITI) official said on Monday.</p>
<p>Earlier, the ministry said Japan's industrial production in August fell a preliminary 1.9 percent from the previous month on a seasonally adjusted basis.</p>
</text>
